CT,30,T
OL,0,          BTXT64  GSat 28.11.26 02:05:21
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,FTeletextC64D]FRequirements             
OL,3,   EUltimateD]GOverview                 
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5,BWhat is needed to run this?            
OL,6, AFCommodore 64 UltimateGor some other  
OL,7, Ultimate product with networking       
OL,8, capabilities like theFUltimate 64Gor   
OL,9,FUltimate EliteGboards.                 
OL,11, Or use aFstock Commodore 64Gwith aF    
OL,12, networking device like the:F           
OL,13,C- Ultimate II+GcartridgeF              
OL,14,C- WiC64Guser port device               
OL,15,C- MeatloafGIEC device                  
OL,17, It also runs fine on aFCommodore 128Gin
OL,18, in C64 mode with one of the above      
OL,19, networking devices.                    
OL,21, That's it. More on the different soft- 
OL,22, ware editions on the next page.        
OL,23,D]F200G<<                >>F202 B]D1/3  
OL,24,AMain page  BA-Z Index  CInstall  FAbout
FL,100,199,200,300,0,100
