OL,0,          BTXT64  GSat 28.11.26 02:05:21
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,FTeletextC64D]FRequirements             
OL,3,   EUltimateD]GOverview                 
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5, Software can be found here:            
OL,6,Cgithub.com/fputmango/Teletext64U       
OL,8,BReleasesGcan be found on the right     
OL,9, side of the GitHub page.               
OL,11, If you have aFWiC64GorFMeatloafGyou    
OL,12, don't need GitHub. The program can be  
OL,13, launched via theEWiC PortalGor via a   
OL,14,Eshort codeGcommand for the Meatloaf:   
OL,16,BLOAD "ML:TELETEXT64",8                 
OL,18, Pretty handy! See pageC305Gfor more    
OL,19, information.                           
OL,21, If you have an Ultimate product, you   
OL,22, have to downloadFTeletext64U.d64       
OL,23,D]F200G<<                >>F202 B]D2/3  
OL,24,AMain page  BA-Z Index  CInstall  FAbout
