OL,0,          BTXT64  GSat 28.11.26 02:05:21
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,FTeletextC64D]FRequirements             
OL,3,   EUltimateD]GOverview                 
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5,BUltimate edition                       
OL,6, For the Ultimate version you have to   
OL,7, enable theFUltimate Command Interface, 
OL,8, or use theERunMeFirst.cfgGfile that    
OL,9, enables this for you. It also sets     
OL,10,FTurbo ControlGtoCC64U Turbo Registers  
OL,11, (C64 Ultimate/Ultimate 64 systems only)
OL,13, You could also apply the teletext.vpl  
OL,14, (VICE palette file) to get bright RGB  
OL,15, colours. This is optional.             
OL,17,BRun the program                        
OL,18, Mount the image and run the teletext   
OL,19, program. It should work right away.    
OL,21, If you want a local custom install,    
OL,22, please read pageC202.                  
OL,23,D]F200G<<                >>F202 B]D3/3  
OL,24,AMain page  BA-Z Index  CInstall  FAbout
